---
layout: docs.njk
title: Tested devices
description: Every device YAML in the gemifi repo, its platform and chip, and what has been checked on real hardware.
permalink: /docs/devices/
crumb: Devices
lede: Every device YAML in the repo, and what has been checked on real hardware. A YAML that builds but hasn't been run is marked so; if you run one, tell us how it went on its issue.
---
{#- Nunjucks' selectattr takes no test: `checked` is set on exactly the "works" entries (the site tests hold it). -#}
{%- set checked = tested | selectattr("checked") -%}
<p>
  <strong>{{ checked.length }} of {{ tested.length }}</strong> device YAMLs have been checked on hardware.
  The list is <a href="{{ site.blob }}site/src/_data/tested.js" rel="noopener"><code>site/src/_data/tested.js</code></a>.
</p>

<div class="table-scroll">
<table class="tested">
  <thead>
    <tr><th>YAML</th><th>Platform</th><th>Status</th><th>Checked on hardware</th><th>Not yet</th></tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    {% for t in tested %}
    <tr>
      <td>
        <a href="{{ site.blob }}{{ t.yaml }}" rel="noopener"><code>{{ t.file }}</code></a><br />
        {% if t.device %}{% for d in collections.devices %}{% if d.page.fileSlug == t.device %}<a href="{{ d.url | url }}">{{ t.name }}</a>{% endif %}{% endfor %}{% else %}{{ t.name }}{% endif %}
      </td>
      <td>
        {% for p in docs.platforms %}{% if t.platform in p.keys %}<a href="{{ p.url | url }}"><code>{{ t.platform }}</code></a>{% endif %}{% endfor %}<br />
        <small>{{ t.chip }}{% if t.board %}, board <code>{{ t.board }}</code>{% endif %}</small>
      </td>
      <td><span class="status status-{{ t.status }}">{{ "Works" if t.status == "works" else "Builds" }}</span>{% if t.checked %}<br /><small class="nowrap">{{ t.checked }}</small>{% endif %}</td>
      <td>{{ t.works or "—" }}</td>
      <td>{{ t.pending }}{% if t.issue %} <a href="{{ site.repo }}/issues/{{ t.issue }}" rel="noopener">#{{ t.issue }}</a>{% endif %}</td>
    </tr>
    {% endfor %}
  </tbody>
</table>
</div>
